+## §76 — `recording_library` — internal training Recording Library (added 2026-10-12 by RL-1 / TRU-248, migration `20261012180000_training_library.sql` APPLIED 2026-10-13 01:21Z — row present, **OFF** `{}`; readers STAGED on branch `feat/sample-redaction`, NOT deployed)
+**Why:** SPEC v0.2 / TR_PLAN: AMs and admins submit Final Expense Sale calls to the in-house redaction worker (`sample-redactor`, Vercel) and QA the redacted call, smart clips and coaching before anything is published to agents.
